## Transparent FSM transaction lifecycle.

use Std.Fsm

fsm Transaction with Int
  Idle --create--> Pending
  Pending --submit--> Awaiting
  Awaiting --confirm--> Settled
  Awaiting --reject--> Failed
    update 0
  Failed --retry--> Pending
    update 0
  Awaiting --on_timer--> Failed
    update 0
  * --cancel--> Cancelled
